# Helicarrier Strike: "Teamwork 2 ... deals 2 damage to target attacking or blocking creature. If this spell was cast using teamwork, it
# deals 4 damage to that creature instead." Bot2 attacks on turn 4 with two Ageless Guardians (1/4). Cast without teamwork, the first
# Strike deals 2 damage to one (it survives with 2 marked, and Bot1's Cabal Evangel stays untapped); cast using teamwork, tapping the
# Evangel (power 2), the second deals 4 to the other, which dies - 4 damage instead of 2, not both. Bot2's Ornithopter, not attacking
# or blocking, can't be targeted (the refusal), and a lone Metallic Sliver (power 1) can't pay teamwork 2 (the refusal).

